:: Temple Privilege Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'temple-duty-prayer'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The <<monk>> looks at your name in the duties book, then steps aside. <span class='green'>"There is a place for you inside, <<temple_title>>."</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<monk>>看过职务簿上的名字，侧身让开。<span class='green'>“里面有你的位置，<<temple_title>>。”</span>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<templeicon 'pray'>>
  <<lanLink ['Pray (1:00)', '祈祷 (1:00)'] 'Temple Prayer Enter'>><</lanLink>>
  <br>
<</widget>>
